  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Archangelskbes&#xF6;k f&#xF6;r anbudsutv&#xE4;rdering i Sverige 1999 03 03-05. En representant fr&#xE5;n l&#xE4;nsstyrelsen i Archangelsk, Larisa Glazko inbjuds till Sida f&#xF6;r diskussioner ang framtida projekt och utv&#xE4;rdering av inkomna anbud ang insatsen &quot;Energy Efficiency in Heavy Industry , Archangelsk&quot;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One representative from the Administrative Board of Archangels County, Larisa Glazko, will during a visit to Sweden take part in discussions on future project, and also carry out evaluations on presented proposals within the project &quot;Energy Efficiency in Heavy Industry , Archangelsk&quot;.</narrative>
